# This machine runs Avast/AVG HTTPS scanning, which re-signs TLS connections with
# a local root certificate. Node ships its own CA bundle and ignores the Windows
# certificate store, so without this flag every outbound HTTPS request from Node
# fails with UNABLE_TO_VERIFY_LEAF_SIGNATURE — including `npm install` and the
# next/image optimizer fetching product photography.
#
# --use-system-ca keeps certificate verification ON and simply trusts the same
# roots Windows trusts. Requires Node 22.15+ or 24+.
node-options=--use-system-ca
